RhetorLint measurement corpus — notices for third-party text
=============================================================

measurement/items/ holds short texts that are redistributed here only to
measure whether RhetorLint's marks agree with a human reader. Every item's
licence, source URL, retrieval date, licence evidence and the exact excerpt
kept are recorded in measurement/items.json. The repository's MIT licence
covers the repository's own code; it does not relicense the texts below.

